WEBVTT

00:04:28.764 --> 00:04:32.101
They are born of the internet
for the internet.

00:04:33.102 --> 00:04:36.147
And NFTs don't simply port our existing
model of ownership

00:04:36.188 --> 00:04:37.648
from the physical world,

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:38.899
they improve it.

00:04:40.151 --> 00:04:43.821
In the physical world, ownership
actually fences people out.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:47.116
It precludes others
from enjoying what you own.

00:04:47.825 --> 00:04:51.078
I wouldn't expect to feel welcome
in your home uninvited.

00:04:52.496 --> 00:04:55.207
Digital space, however, is expansive.

00:04:55.207 --> 00:04:57.293
It's home to the infinite,
the exponential,

00:04:57.335 --> 00:04:59.337
the instantaneous.

00:04:59.378 --> 00:05:03.549
NFTs offer a system of ownership
that reflects this expansiveness.